  Composite strategies (run a primary workflow, then refine dynamic-access coverage):
  
  | Strategy name | Agent | Primary workflow |
  |---|---|---|
  | `javac_iterative_with_coverage_sources_pi_gpt-5.4` | `pi` | `javac_iterative` |
